@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Metric UML: risk, performance, and portfolio quantities

abstract class Metric {
  +metric_id: string
  +value: float
  +source: string
  +profile: string
}

class AssetValue {
  +asset_value: float
  +asset_value_source: string
}

class EventProbability {
  +likelihood: float
  +cvss_exploitability: float
  +cvss_source: string
  +alpha: float
  +beta: float
}

class ImpactLevel {
  +confidentiality: float
  +integrity: float
  +availability: float
  +impact_source: string
}

class HumanFactorMetric {
  +hf_score: float
  +hf_source: string
  +policy_violations: float
  +training_gap: float
}

class BaseRisk {
  +br_value: float
  +formula: string
}

class ControlEffect {
  +control_id: string
  +effectiveness: float
  +detect_gain: float
  +fpr_delta: float
  +cost_source: string
}

class ResidualRisk {
  +mean_residual: float
  +p90_residual: float
  +hf_reduction: float
}

class DetectionMetric {
  +f1: float
  +auroc: float
  +pr_auc: float
  +brier: float
  +fpr: float
  +threshold_source: string
}

class CostMetric {
  +capex: float
  +opex: float
  +ai_opex: float
  +tco_3y: float
}

class PortfolioObjective {
  +mean_residual_risk: float
  +tco_3y: float
  +false_positive_rate: float
  +detection_rate: float
  +selector_weight_source: string
}

Metric <|-- AssetValue
Metric <|-- EventProbability
Metric <|-- ImpactLevel
Metric <|-- HumanFactorMetric
Metric <|-- DetectionMetric
Metric <|-- CostMetric

BaseRisk --> AssetValue : AV
BaseRisk --> EventProbability : EP
BaseRisk --> ImpactLevel : IL
BaseRisk ..> HumanFactorMetric : optional HF
ResidualRisk --> BaseRisk
ResidualRisk --> ControlEffect : product of effects
PortfolioObjective --> ResidualRisk
PortfolioObjective --> CostMetric
PortfolioObjective --> DetectionMetric
ControlEffect --> CostMetric : control-side costs

note right of EventProbability
Strict public profile:
cvss_source = global_neutral_prior.
Exploitability is constant, not row-varying.
end note

note bottom of PortfolioObjective
Default selector weights are artifact settings,
not stakeholder-elicited utilities.
end note
@enduml
